        language.add("tooltip.item.confluence.guide_voodoo_doll.wall.2", "Sealed within Its heart is the world's most primal, untamed power, which shall fully unleash when Its mortal form crumbles.", "祂的心脏中封印着这个世界最本质，最狂野的力量，将在肉身坍塌后尽数释放。");
